          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaakoba Abaisiraeli ati: “Ghasobola okubaagho Abaisiraeli babiri nga bali n'enkaayana ghagati ghaibwe. Baaja y'abalamuzi baabagha ensala owundi yaasinga omusango, ate owundi gwamusinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ole ye gusinze bw'anaabanga ng'aiziiza omusango ogumugwaniza okukubwa, omulamuzi aidha kulagiranga bamulambaaze mu maiso ge, memale bamukube emikuzi egisaanira omusango gwe yaiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omulamuzi asobola okumusalira okumukuba emikuzi egighera amakumi ana, aye taidha kuswikangagho. Okumukuba egisinga agho kuba kumuswaza mu baine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
